**References:**

- [Test Anything with Pex](http://research.microsoft.com/en-us/um/people/simonpj/papers/msei11-pex/msei11-pex-web.pdf)
- [Code Contracts: A Commodity Model for Contract Programming](https://arxiv.org/abs/cs/0212002)
- [Code Contracts for the .NET 4.0 Framework](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/debug-trace-profile/code-contracts)
- [Postcondition attribute](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/microsoft.practices.precondition.postconditionattribute)

